        "comments": "The assembly dcHonPepl1.hap1.2 is based on 29x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Heterozygous inversions were observed on the following chromosomes of this assembly: Chromosome 15\n60.5-68.4 Mbp, Chromosome 16\n45.8-61 Mbp, Chromosome 23\n41.5-69.5 Mbp and Chromosome 33\n25.6-60 Mbp.",
